        <section id="about" class="bg-white py-20">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
                <h2 class="font-ysabeau-sc text-4xl font-bold text-center text-gray-800 mb-12">About Me</h2>
                <div class="md:flex md:items-center">
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 mb-8 md:mb-0">
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/600/400" alt="About Me" class="rounded-lg shadow-lg">
                    </div>
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:ml-12">
                        <h3 class="font-ysabeau-sc text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4">My Journey in Photography</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Driven by a lifelong passion for visual storytelling, I embarked on my photography journey over a decade ago. My work focuses on capturing the essence of moments, from the raw emotion of portraits to the serene beauty of landscapes. I believe in the power of an image to transcend words and evoke deep feelings.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                            Through years of experience and continuous learning, I've honed my skills in various photographic styles, always seeking to push creative boundaries and deliver impactful visuals.
