                    <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">Explore a variety of flavorful vegetarian recipes that are both healthy and easy to make...</p>
                    <a href="#" class="text-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-700 font-semibold transition-colors">Read Article <i class="fa fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i></a>
