                    </p>
                    <button class="btn-primary text-black font-semibold py-3 px-8 rounded-full hover:shadow-electric shadow-md">
                        Register Now <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="hidden md:block animate-slide-up delay-100">
                    <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl shadow-electric">
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/600/400" alt="Virtual Event" class="w-full block">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-40"></div>
                        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-6">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold electric-blue mb-2">Upcoming Event: Tech Innovation Summit</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">Explore the latest trends and technologies shaping our future.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="schedule" class="bg-gray-900 py-20">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 electric-blue animate-fade-in">Event Schedule</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 animate-slide-up">
                <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg shadow-electric">
                    <div class="bg-black p-6 schedule-item">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg electric-blue mb-2">Day 1: Innovation & Technology</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Keynote speeches and sessions focused on cutting-edge technologies and innovative strategies.</p>
                        <ul class="space-y-2">
                            <li><i class="fa-regular fa-clock electric-blue mr-2"></i> 9:00 AM - 10:00 AM: Opening Keynote</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-regular fa-clock electric-blue mr-2"></i> 10:30 AM - 11:30 AM: Session 1: AI in Business</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-regular fa-clock electric-blue mr-2"></i> 1:00 PM - 2:00 PM: Session 2: Future of Web3</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg shadow-electric">
                    <div class="bg-black p-6 schedule-item">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg electric-blue mb-2">Day 2: Leadership & Growth</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Workshops and panels dedicated to leadership development and business growth strategies.</p>
                        <ul class="space-y-2">
                            <li><i class="fa-regular fa-clock electric-blue mr-2"></i> 9:00 AM - 10:00 AM: Leadership Panel</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-regular fa-clock electric-blue mr-2"></i> 10:30 AM - 12:00 PM: Workshop: Agile Management</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-regular fa-clock electric-blue mr-2"></i> 1:30 PM - 2:30 PM: Growth Hacking Session</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg shadow-electric">
                    <div class="bg-black p-6 schedule-item">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg electric-blue mb-2">Day 3: Networking & Collaboration</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Interactive sessions and networking events to foster collaboration and build connections.</p>
                        <ul class="space-y-2">
                            <li><i class="fa-regular fa-clock electric-blue mr-2"></i> 10:00 AM - 11:30 AM: Networking Session</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-regular fa-clock electric-blue mr-2"></i> 1:00 PM - 2:30 PM: Collaborative Workshop</li>
                            <li><i class="fa-regular fa-clock electric-blue mr-2"></i> 3:00 PM - 4:00 PM: Closing Remarks</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="register" class="bg-gray-900 py-20">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 electric-blue animate-fade-in">Register Now</h2>
            <div class="max-w-md mx-auto animate-slide-up">
                <div class="bg-black p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-electric">
                    <form class="space-y-6">
                        <div>
                            <label for="name" class="block mb-2 text-gray-300">Full Name</label>
                            <input type="text" id="name" class="form-input w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-md" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label for="email" class="block mb-2 text-gray-300">Email Address</label>
                            <input type="email" id="email" class="form-input w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-md" placeholder="Your Email" required>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label for="ticket" class="block mb-2 text-gray-300">Ticket Type</label>
                            <select id="ticket" class="form-input w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-md">
                                <option value="standard">Standard Access</option>
                                <option value="vip">VIP Access</option>
                                <option value="premium">Premium Access</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary w-full py-3 rounded-full font-semibold hover:shadow-electric shadow-md">
                            Complete Registration <i class="fa-solid fa-check ml-2"></i>
                        </button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-black py-12">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center text-gray-400 animate-fade-in">
            <p>&copy; 2024 Virtual Event Platform. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p class="mt-4">
                <a href="#" class="hover:electric-blue transition-colors">Terms of Service</a> |
                <a href="#" class="hover:electric-blue transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        const mobileMenuButton = document.getElementById('mobile-menu-button');
        const mobileMenu = document.getElementById('mobile-menu');

        mobileMenuButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
            mobileMenu.classList.toggle('hidden');
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
