    <section id="about" class="py-20 bg-gray-800 text-white text-center">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">About the <span class="red-highlight">Exhibition</span></h2>
            <p class="text-lg mb-8">This exhibition explores the beauty of monochrome photography, highlighting the interplay of light and shadow. Each photograph is carefully curated to showcase the world in shades of gray, punctuated by striking red accents to draw attention to key details and emotions.</p>
            <p class="text-lg">Discover the stories behind the images and the artists who captured them. Immerse yourself in a visual journey that transcends color and focuses on form, texture, and composition.</p>
        </div>
