                        <p class="text-sm">Bathing the world in the warm hues of the setting sun.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="masonry-item">
                    <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/40/300/500" alt="Image 4">
                    <div class="masonry-item-overlay">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Candid Moments</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm">Unscripted glimpses into everyday life.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
