                        <p class="text-sm">The city comes alive under the cloak of darkness.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="masonry-item">
                    <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/70/500/300" alt="Image 7">
                    <div class="masonry-item-overlay">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Monochrome Magic</h3>
