                <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">How was your experience today?</p>
                <div class="flex justify-center space-x-8">
                    <i class="far fa-angry text-4xl text-yellow-500 cursor-pointer hover:scale-125 transition-transform animate-pulse-icon" onclick="setRating('angry')"></i>
