```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Echoes of Time - A Vintage Timeline</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700&family=Roboto:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f0e3;
            color: #5e2605;
        }
        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, .font-playfair {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            color: #704214;
        }
        .sepia-filter {
            filter: sepia(80%);
        }
        .vignette {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .vignette:after {
            content: "";
            display: block;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .timeline-line {
            position: relative;
        }

        .timeline-line::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 2px;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: #d2b48c;
            z-index: -1;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .timeline-line::after {
                left: 10%;
            }
        }

        .timeline-item {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .timeline-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .timeline-date {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background-color: #b8860b;
            color: #f8f0e3;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: 500;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            z-index: 1;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .timeline-date {
                left: 10%;
                transform: translateX(0);
            }
        }


        .timeline-content {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            margin-top: 20px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 0;
        }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .timeline-content {
                width: 45%;
            }

            .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) .timeline-content {
                left: 5%;
            }

            .timeline-item:nth-child(even) .timeline-content {
                right: 5%;
                left: auto;
            }

            .timeline-date {
                top: -10px;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .timeline-content {
                margin-left: auto;
                margin-right: auto;
                width: 80%;
            }
        }

        .timeline-content h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .timeline-content p {
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .zoom-in-image {
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .zoom-in-image:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-beige-100">
    <nav class="bg-beige-100 bg-opacity-80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50 shadow-md">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16">
                <div class="flex items-center">
                    <span class="font-playfair font-bold text-xl">Echoes of Time</span>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:block">
                    <div class="ml-4 flex items-center space-x-4">
                        <a href="#timeline" class="hover:text-brown-200 transition-colors">Timeline</a>
                        <a href="#about" class="hover:text-brown-200 transition-colors">About</a>
                        <a href="#contact" class="hover:text-brown-200 transition-colors">Contact</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="-mr-2 flex md:hidden">
                    <button id="mobile-menu-button" type="button" class="bg-beige-100 inline-flex items-center justify-center p-2 rounded-md text-brown-100 hover:text-brown-200 hover:bg-beige-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-inset focus:ring-brown-200" aria-controls="mobile-menu" aria-expanded="false">
                        <span class="sr-only">Open main menu</span>
                        <i class="fa fa-bars" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="md:hidden hidden" id="mobile-menu">
            <div class="px-2 pt-2 pb-3 space-y-1 sm:px-3">
                <a href="#timeline" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-base font-medium text-brown-100 hover:text-brown-200 hover:bg-beige-200">Timeline</a>
                <a href="#about" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-base font-medium text-brown-100 hover:text-brown-200 hover:bg-beige-200">About</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-base font-medium text-brown-100 hover:text-brown-200 hover:bg-beige-200">Contact</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="relative overflow-hidden h-screen vignette">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/2000/1000" alt="Vintage Scene" class="w-full h-full object-cover sepia-filter">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
            <h1 class="font-playfair text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-brown-200 mb-4 animate-fade-in">A Journey Through Time</h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brown-100 opacity-90 max-w-xl mb-8 animate-fade-in delay-200">Explore pivotal moments that shaped our world. Uncover stories of the past with our interactive vintage timeline.</p>
            <a href="#timeline" class="bg-brown-200 text-beige-100 px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-brown-300 transition-colors animate-fade-in delay-400">
                Explore the Timeline
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="timeline" class="py-20">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <h2 class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12">Our Historical Timeline</h2>
            <div class="timeline-line">
                <div class="timeline-item" data-year="1900">
                    <div class="timeline-date">1900</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content group">
                        <h3 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-semibold group-hover:text-brown-300 transition-colors">The Dawn of a New Century</h3>
                        <p>The world enters the 20th century, marked by optimism and technological advancements. The Belle Époque flourishes in Europe, while industrialization transforms societies.</p>
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300" alt="1900s Event" class="mt-4 rounded-md zoom-in-image sepia-filter group-hover:sepia-filter-none transition-filter">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item" data-year="1920">
                    <div class="timeline-date">1920</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content group">
                        <h3 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-semibold group-hover:text-brown-300 transition-colors">Roaring Twenties</h3>
                        <p>A decade of economic prosperity and cultural dynamism in Western society. Jazz music, flapper fashion, and Art Deco define the era.</p>
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/401/300" alt="1920s Event" class="mt-4 rounded-md zoom-in-image sepia-filter group-hover:sepia-filter-none transition-filter">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item" data-year="1940">
                    <div class="timeline-date">1940</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content group">
                        <h3 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-semibold group-hover:text-brown-300 transition-colors">World War II Era</h3>
                        <p>Global conflict reshapes the world order. Innovations in technology and profound social changes occur amidst wartime struggles.</p>
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/402/300" alt="1940s Event" class="mt-4 rounded-md zoom-in-image sepia-filter group-hover:sepia-filter-none transition-filter">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item" data-year="1960">
                    <div class="timeline-date">1960</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content group">
                        <h3 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-semibold group-hover:text-brown-300 transition-colors">Swinging Sixties</h3>
                        <p>A revolutionary decade marked by social upheaval, civil rights movements, and the space race. Pop culture and music experience a dramatic transformation.</p>
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/403/300" alt="1960s Event" class="mt-4 rounded-md zoom-in-image sepia-filter group-hover:sepia-filter-none transition-filter">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item" data-year="1980">
                    <div class="timeline-date">1980</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content group">
                        <h3 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-semibold group-hover:text-brown-300 transition-colors">The Digital Revolution Begins</h3>
                        <p>The rise of personal computers and the early internet era. The Cold War nears its end, and globalization starts to accelerate.</p>
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/404/300" alt="1980s Event" class="mt-4 rounded-md zoom-in-image sepia-filter group-hover:sepia-filter-none transition-filter">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="py-20 bg-beige-50 vignette">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
            <h2 class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold mb-8">About Echoes of Time</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-brown-100 leading-relaxed mb-8">
                "Echoes of Time" is dedicated to bringing history to life through an engaging and visually rich experience. Our mission is to illuminate the past, making it accessible and fascinating for everyone. We believe in the power of stories to connect us across generations and to understand the present by exploring the echoes of yesterday.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-brown-100 leading-relaxed">
                This timeline was created with passion and meticulous research, aiming to offer not just dates and facts, but a sense of the atmosphere and spirit of each era. We hope you enjoy this journey through time as much as we enjoyed creating it.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="py-20 bg-beige-100">
        <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
            <h2 class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Contact Us</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-brown-100 leading-relaxed mb-8">
