            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="entries" class="py-20">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center">Recent Entries</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 subtle-shadow hover-lift">
                    <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/10/400/300" alt="Journal Entry Image" class="rounded-md mb-4 w-full h-48 object-cover">
                    <h3 class="journal-entry-title mb-2">A Day in the Life</h3>
                    <p class="journal-entry-date mb-3">November 18, 2024</p>
                    <p class="journal-entry-content">Today was a day of simple joys. Woke up to the sound of rain, brewed a cup of coffee...</p>
                    <a href="#" class="inline-block mt-4 text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 font-semibold transition-colors">Read more <i class="fa fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i></a>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 subtle-shadow hover-lift">
                    <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/20/400/300" alt="Journal Entry Image" class="rounded-md mb-4 w-full h-48 object-cover">
                    <h3 class="journal-entry-title mb-2">Reflections on Nature</h3>
                    <p class="journal-entry-date mb-3">November 15, 2024</p>
                    <p class="journal-entry-content">Spent the afternoon walking through the woods. The colors of the leaves are simply breathtaking...</p>
                    <a href="#" class="inline-block mt-4 text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 font-semibold transition-colors">Read more <i class="fa fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i></a>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 subtle-shadow hover-lift">
                    <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/30/400/300" alt="Journal Entry Image" class="rounded-md mb-4 w-full h-48 object-cover">
                    <h3 class="journal-entry-title mb-2">Dreaming of the Future</h3>
                    <p class="journal-entry-date mb-3">November 10, 2024</p>
                    <p class="journal-entry-content">Laying in bed last night, I started thinking about where I want to be in five years. It's exciting and a little scary...</p>
                    <a href="#" class="inline-block mt-4 text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 font-semibold transition-colors">Read more <i class="fa fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="categories" class="py-20 bg-gray-100">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center">Explore Categories</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-6 justify-center">
                <a href="#" class="bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 subtle-shadow hover-lift text-center block">
                    <i class="fa fa-leaf text-green-500 mr-2"></i> Nature
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 subtle-shadow hover-lift text-center block">
                    <i class="fa fa-heart text-pink-500 mr-2"></i> Personal
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 subtle-shadow hover-lift text-center block">
                    <i class="fa fa-briefcase text-yellow-500 mr-2"></i> Work
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 subtle-shadow hover-lift text-center block">
                    <i class="fa fa-lightbulb text-purple-500 mr-2"></i> Ideas
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 subtle-shadow hover-lift text-center block">
                    <i class="fa fa-book text-blue-500 mr-2"></i> Reading
                </a>
                <a href="#" class="bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 subtle-shadow hover-lift text-center block">
                    <i class="fa fa-camera text-orange-500 mr-2"></i> Travel
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="py-20">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center max-w-2xl">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">About This Journal</h2>
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/40/600/400" alt="About Journal" class="rounded-xl mb-8 subtle-shadow w-full">
            <p class="journal-entry-content mb-6">
                This digital journal is designed to be a serene and minimalist space for your thoughts and reflections. 
                It's crafted with soft colors and gentle typography to provide a calming experience, encouraging you to write and explore your inner world.
            </p>
            <p class="journal-entry-content">
                Whether you want to document your daily life, brainstorm ideas, or simply unwind after a long day, this journal is here for you. 
                Enjoy the simplicity and elegance, and make it your own.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-gray-200 py-12">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center text-gray-600">
            <p>&copy; 2024 Digital Journal. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Crafted with <i class="fa fa-heart text-pink-500"></i> and <a href="https://tailwindcss.com/" class="text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors">Tailwind CSS</a></p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const mobileMenuButton = document.getElementById('mobile-menu-button');
            const mobileMenu = document.getElementById('mobile-menu');

            mobileMenuButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
                mobileMenu.classList.toggle('hidden');
            });

             const fadeInElements = document.querySelectorAll('.fade-in');

             const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
                 entries.forEach(entry => {
                     if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                         entry.target.classList.add('visible');
                         observer.unobserve(entry.target);
                     }
                 });
             }, {
                 threshold: 0.1
             });

             fadeInElements.forEach(element => {
                 observer.observe(element);
             });
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
