                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 font-playfair warm-red">Our Kitchen Story</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Welcome to our digital cookbook, a curated collection of recipes inspired by warm kitchens and shared meals. We believe in the power of home cooking and the joy of creating delicious food for family and friends. This platform is designed to be your go-to resource for culinary inspiration, from everyday meals to special occasion dishes.</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-700">Explore our recipes, build your ingredient lists, and enjoy the process of cooking. Happy cooking!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-warm-red text-white py-8 md:py-12">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 text-center">
            <p>&copy; 2024 Digital Cookbook. All rights reserved.</p>
            <div class="mt-4 flex justify-center space-x-6">
                <a href="#" class="hover:text-beige-light transition-colors"><i class="fab fa-facebook-square fa-lg"></i></a>
                <a href="#" class="hover:text-beige-light transition-colors"><i class="fab fa-instagram fa-lg"></i></a>
                <a href="#" class="hover:text-beige-light transition-colors"><i class="fab fa-pinterest fa-lg"></i></a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

<script>
     document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
        const mobileMenuButton = document.getElementById('mobile-menu-button');
        const mobileMenu = document.getElementById('mobile-menu');

        mobileMenuButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
            mobileMenu.classList.toggle('hidden');
        });
    });
</script>

</body>
</html>
